s, Robots).\\\"\\\\n  - [6]: \\\"Sustained interest in space topics (stars, moon, planets, rockets, astronauts). Browsing pattern shows he likes exploring multiple options before settling on activities. Recent sessions show consistent return to space-related content.\\\"\\\\n  - [7]: \\\"Session (April 9, evening—continued): Gal expressed worry about lost item, then returned to home board. He then selected Interests → Space → Stars, showing continued sustained interest in space topics. Currently exploring star-related activities (facts, drawing, colors, constellations).\\\"\\\\n  - [8]: \\\"Session (April 9, evening—final): Gal pressed Feelings → Scared, then selected Home to return to safety. Later navigated Interests → Space, showing his pattern of seeking comfort when scared, then returning to preferred activities. Demonstrates emotional awareness and ability to self-regulate by seeking home/safety.\\\"\\\\n  - [9]: \\\"Session (April 9, evening—continued): Gal initiated guessing mode with 'I'm thinking about' button. Narrowed down to Places category and is exploring place options (Home, Park, School, Friend's house). Shows continued engagement with structured guessing mode.\\\"\\\\n  - [10]: \\\"Session (April 9, evening—continued): Gal initiated guessing mode and narrowed down to 'Lost something at school.' Through structured elimination, confirmed he lost his HAT at school. This is a specific item loss that matches his earlier concern about losing something outside.\\\"\\\\n  ↪ To append: action \\\"add\\\" at \\\"/Student_Notes\\\" with value. To update item: action \\\"set\\\" at \\\"/Student_Notes/<index>\\\".\",\"mutatedPaths\":[\"/Student_Notes/0\",\"/Student_Notes/1\",\"/Student_Notes/2\",\"/Student_Notes/3\",\"/Student_Notes/4\",\"/Student_Notes/5\",\"/Student_Notes/6\",\"/Student_Notes/7\",\"/Student_Notes/8\",\"/Student_Notes/9\",\"/Student_Notes/10\"],\"summary\":\"Array with 11 item(s)\"}]"
