ocused engagement with interactive reflex games and continues to prefer hands-on, interactive activities.\\\"\\\\n  - [8]: \\\"Current Sessions (April 19): Gal engaged in weather and space exploration via YouTube. Session flow: Interact → Science → Weather → Rain → YouTube (rain video search), then Interact → Apps → YouTube → Space (repeated interest). Demonstrates sustained engagement with science topics and multimedia learning. Shows persistent interest in space content via YouTube. Note: Gal cycled between YouTube and Space buttons repeatedly, suggesting possible difficulty finding desired specific content or need for clearer content suggestions (e.g., 'Want to watch a rocket launch video?'). Consider direct activity suggestions rather than abstract topic buttons.\\\"\\\\n  ↪ To append: action \\\"add\\\" at \\\"/Student_Notes\\\" with value. To update item: action \\\"set\\\" at \\\"/Student_Notes/<index>\\\".\",\"mutatedPaths\":[\"/Student_Notes/0\",\"/Student_Notes/1\",\"/Student_Notes/2\",\"/Student_Notes/3\",\"/Student_Notes/4\",\"/Student_Notes/5\",\"/Student_Notes/6\",\"/Student_Notes/7\",\"/Student_Notes/8\"],\"summary\":\"Array with 9 item(s)\"}]"
